WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:11.060
Products, with options like size and colour, price, stock, images and category. The assistant only offers the products and prices on this page.

2
00:00:11.609 --> 00:00:19.730
Click New product, and set the name, price and category. In Other names, write the names your customers use.

3
00:00:20.277 --> 00:00:27.580
Add options, like size or colour. After saving, you set a price and stock for each combination.

4
00:00:28.134 --> 00:00:37.450
Add images, and change every price and stock at once with Bulk edit. Keep stock current, so the assistant never sells what is out of stock.
